# External research datasets pulled by the bench harness. Too large to
# version-control, redistributable from upstream. The bench script
# (tests/bench_dataset.py) walks dataset/ at runtime.
#   - dataset/SecurityEval-main/             from github.com/s2e-lab/SecurityEval
#   - dataset/copilot-cwe-scenarios-dataset/ from zenodo.org/records/5225651
dataset/

